{"id":"be4jcju6vahiyif15g5hn5ix8","title":"卡游上市受阻：IP依赖与港股估值矛盾分析","originalTitle":"Hitcard抢跑“卡牌第一股”，最难受的是卡游？","summary":"卡游因IP依赖与港股估值环境问题两次上市受阻，收入高度集中于奥特曼等五大IP（占比86.1%），面临未成年人消费争议及新品类毛利率低挑战。对比日本成熟卡牌市场，揭示中国卡牌产业两种发展路径：资本整合型（如姚记科技）与IP深耕型（如卡游自身），前者需解决协同效应风险，后者需平衡IP生命周期与多元化布局。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15347751.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T10:59:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T12:07:01.715Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T12:07:01.715Z","category":"stock-cn","tags":["财报","政策发布"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(趣解商业)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"},{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}